  ('ai:ai-batch-07:edc1ed6fa364','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is Joe''s job?',array['cook','taxi driver','bus driver','teacher']::text[],'C','''I''m a bus driver in Manchester.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Hi, I''m Joe. I''m a bus driver in Manchester. I start work at six in the morning, so I get up very early. I finish at two o''clock. In the afternoon I sleep for an hour and then I cook dinner. My wife is a teacher. We have two sons, Leo and Max.',null,null,null,'practice'),
