  ('ai:ai-batch-07:8cad636b9606','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where did the writer go on Saturday?',array['to the market','to the beach','to the cinema','to school']::text[],'A','''On Saturday I went to the market with my sister.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Last weekend was great. On Saturday I went to the market with my sister. We bought fruit and a new bag for her. In the evening we watched a film at home. On Sunday it rained, so we stayed in and played board games. I was very tired on Monday!',null,null,null,'practice'),
