  ('ai:ai-batch-07:85e6341b29a6','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Luna wear?',array['a white collar','a bell','a red collar','a blue coat']::text[],'C','''She has... a red collar.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','LOST! Small black cat. Her name is Luna. She has a white nose and a red collar. She was last seen on Hill Road on Friday evening. Please call Ben on 07700 900456.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:a7b46beaf0a2','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What is the weather like in Cornwall?',array['snowy','warm and sunny','windy','cold and rainy']::text[],'B','''The weather is warm and sunny.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Dear Grandma, We are in Cornwall! Our hotel is next to the beach. The weather is warm and sunny. Every day we swim in the sea and eat ice cream. Yesterday Dad took us on a boat. Tomorrow we are going to a castle. Love, Emma',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:63ed5aa42383','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What doesn''t Maya like?',array['her dog','the park','maths','art']::text[],'C','''She doesn''t like maths.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Maya is nine. She lives in Bristol with her mum and her grandfather. Every morning her grandfather takes her to school. Maya''s favourite lesson is art. She doesn''t like maths. After school she plays with her dog, Biscuit, in the park. On Sundays she visits her dad in Bath.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:abe3efecdf73','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Who teaches the English class?',array['one of the students','Mr Brown','Mr Green','Mrs Green']::text[],'C','''The teacher is Mr Green.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Our English class is on Tuesdays and Thursdays from 6 to 8 pm. The teacher is Mr Green. There are twelve students in the class. They come from six countries. After the class some students go to the café for a cup of tea.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:0266ff818dce','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What did they do on Saturday evening?',array['went to the market','played board games','watched a film','went swimming']::text[],'C','''In the evening we watched a film at home.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Last weekend was great. On Saturday I went to the market with my sister. We bought fruit and a new bag for her. In the evening we watched a film at home. On Sunday it rained, so we stayed in and played board games. I was very tired on Monday!',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:5e1cd5371cb5','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where does the customer want to go?',array['Platform 4','the airport','London','Oxford']::text[],'D','''I''d like a ticket to Oxford.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Assistant: Good morning. Can I help you? — Customer: Yes, please. I''d like a ticket to Oxford. — Assistant: Single or return? — Customer: Return, please. — Assistant: That''s £18. — Customer: Can I pay by card? — Assistant: Of course. The train leaves from platform 4 at 10:15.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:3f81f36b2c66','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What kind of ticket does the customer buy?',array['a return ticket','two tickets','a single ticket','a day ticket']::text[],'A','''Return, please.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Assistant: Good morning. Can I help you? — Customer: Yes, please. I''d like a ticket to Oxford. — Assistant: Single or return? — Customer: Return, please. — Assistant: That''s £18. — Customer: Can I pay by card? — Assistant: Of course. The train leaves from platform 4 at 10:15.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:d61fabc8eaf4','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How much is the ticket?',array['£10.15','£18','£4','£8']::text[],'B','''That''s £18.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Assistant: Good morning. Can I help you? — Customer: Yes, please. I''d like a ticket to Oxford. — Assistant: Single or return? — Customer: Return, please. — Assistant: That''s £18. — Customer: Can I pay by card? — Assistant: Of course. The train leaves from platform 4 at 10:15.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:cf83c7dc9999','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How does the customer pay?',array['by phone','by card','he doesn''t pay','in cash']::text[],'B','''Can I pay by card? — Of course.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Assistant: Good morning. Can I help you? — Customer: Yes, please. I''d like a ticket to Oxford. — Assistant: Single or return? — Customer: Return, please. — Assistant: That''s £18. — Customer: Can I pay by card? — Assistant: Of course. The train leaves from platform 4 at 10:15.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:a7388a05e233','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What time does the train leave?',array['10:40','10:15','4:15','10:04']::text[],'B','''The train leaves from platform 4 at 10:15.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Assistant: Good morning. Can I help you? — Customer: Yes, please. I''d like a ticket to Oxford. — Assistant: Single or return? — Customer: Return, please. — Assistant: That''s £18. — Customer: Can I pay by card? — Assistant: Of course. The train leaves from platform 4 at 10:15.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:13e91e7ed329','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where does Nadia work?',array['in a school','in a hotel','in Egypt','in a restaurant']::text[],'B','''Nadia works in a hotel.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Nadia works in a hotel from Monday to Friday. Saturday is her day off. On Saturday morning she sleeps late and has a big breakfast. Then she phones her mother in Egypt. In the afternoon she goes shopping or meets her friends. She goes to bed early because on Sunday she has a cooking class.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:a880dde5ec25','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','What does Nadia do on Saturday morning?',array['She has a cooking class.','She goes to work.','She goes shopping.','She sleeps late and has a big breakfast.']::text[],'D','''She sleeps late and has a big breakfast.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Nadia works in a hotel from Monday to Friday. Saturday is her day off. On Saturday morning she sleeps late and has a big breakfast. Then she phones her mother in Egypt. In the afternoon she goes shopping or meets her friends. She goes to bed early because on Sunday she has a cooking class.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:b62f24c6e41b','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Who does Nadia phone?',array['her boss','her mother','her friends','her cooking teacher']::text[],'B','''Then she phones her mother in Egypt.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Nadia works in a hotel from Monday to Friday. Saturday is her day off. On Saturday morning she sleeps late and has a big breakfast. Then she phones her mother in Egypt. In the afternoon she goes shopping or meets her friends. She goes to bed early because on Sunday she has a cooking class.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:f6e53544f968','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why does Nadia go to bed early on Saturday?',array['Her mother visits.','She has a cooking class on Sunday.','She works on Sunday.','She is ill.']::text[],'B','''...because on Sunday she has a cooking class.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Nadia works in a hotel from Monday to Friday. Saturday is her day off. On Saturday morning she sleeps late and has a big breakfast. Then she phones her mother in Egypt. In the afternoon she goes shopping or meets her friends. She goes to bed early because on Sunday she has a cooking class.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:4137d68f4153','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Why is the library closed on 12th May?',array['for cleaning','because of new books','because it is Saturday','for a holiday']::text[],'A','''...closed on Friday 12th May for cleaning.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Library News. The library is closed on Friday 12th May for cleaning. From Monday 15th May there are new opening times: Monday to Friday 9 am – 7 pm, Saturday 10 am – 4 pm. You can now borrow ten books at a time.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:11b3e3bde615','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','From 15th May, when does the library close on weekdays?',array['9 pm','7 pm','4 pm','6 pm']::text[],'B','''Monday to Friday 9 am – 7 pm.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Library News. The library is closed on Friday 12th May for cleaning. From Monday 15th May there are new opening times: Monday to Friday 9 am – 7 pm, Saturday 10 am – 4 pm. You can now borrow ten books at a time.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:c582bcbdd322','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','How many books can you borrow now?',array['four','ten','twelve','five']::text[],'B','''You can now borrow ten books at a time.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Library News. The library is closed on Friday 12th May for cleaning. From Monday 15th May there are new opening times: Monday to Friday 9 am – 7 pm, Saturday 10 am – 4 pm. You can now borrow ten books at a time.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:07c1fccf2486','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','When does the library open on Saturdays?',array['4 pm','9 am','10 am','7 pm']::text[],'C','''Saturday 10 am – 4 pm.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Library News. The library is closed on Friday 12th May for cleaning. From Monday 15th May there are new opening times: Monday to Friday 9 am – 7 pm, Saturday 10 am – 4 pm. You can now borrow ten books at a time.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:9fcc70654716','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Which platform does the train leave from?',array['18','15','4','10']::text[],'C','''...from platform 4.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Assistant: Good morning. Can I help you? — Customer: Yes, please. I''d like a ticket to Oxford. — Assistant: Single or return? — Customer: Return, please. — Assistant: That''s £18. — Customer: Can I pay by card? — Assistant: Of course. The train leaves from platform 4 at 10:15.',null,null,null,'practice'),
  ('ai:ai-batch-07:2018f8560f4b','A1'::public.cefr_level,'reading','Where is Nadia''s mother?',array['at the shops','in England','in Egypt','in the hotel']::text[],'C','''...her mother in Egypt.''',array['reading','story']::text[],'draft','unreviewed','ai-draft:ai-batch-07','Nadia works in a hotel from Monday to Friday. Saturday is her day off. On Saturday morning she sleeps late and has a big breakfast. Then she phones her mother in Egypt. In the afternoon she goes shopping or meets her friends. She goes to bed early because on Sunday she has a cooking class.',null,null,null,'practice'),
